### Phase 1: Bug Fixes (Immediate Findings)
1.  **[FIXED] Infinite Reload Loop**: All roles experienced an infinite reload loop on pages using filtered `useData`.
    - *Fix*: Refactored `useData` to use `useRef` for the fetcher.
2.  **[FIXED] Data Visibility after Teacher Deletion**: Student data (assignments, results) was disappearing when a teacher was removed.
    - *Fix*: Refactored backend queries to use `LEFT JOIN` and `COALESCE`. Academic data is now tied to the **Module**, not just the User ID. If a teacher is deleted, the work remains visible and assigned to a "Former Teacher" until a new one is appointed.
    - *Continuity*: Updated Teacher routes so that a new teacher assigned to an existing module automatically inherits and has control over all previous materials and announcements.

