### Phase 3: Observational System Behavior
- [x] NTP Time Sync (Fairness check): Server now synchronizes with pool.ntp.org every 5 minutes.
- [x] Background Polling (Dynamic updates): Student dashboard polls every 10s; announcements every 15s.
- [x] Color Coding (Admin vs Teacher announcements): Admin (Red), Teacher (Green).
- [x] Submission Locking (Anti-cheating): Submissions are locked once sent.
- [x] Jaccard Similarity: Assignments are flagged for duplication at >70% similarity.

### Final Conclusion
The system is now stable and fair. The infinite reload bug has been resolved, and all time-sensitive logic is correctly anchored to the NTP-synced server time.
